// The sprites of the snake: 8 by 8 pixels, in cells of 10, so that there is a
// pixel of room all round; what it eats and the bonuses are 10 by 10, the whole
// cell. # ink, . paper, _ transparent. The head looks four
// ways, and the tail points away from the body the same four. The icon of the
// game in the gallery is 32 by 32.

